{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1283424-lunars-kickstarter-february-12th","id":1283424,"title":"Lunars Kickstarter - February 12th","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-01-28T20:54:44-08:00","id":1283424,"title":"Lunars Kickstarter - February 12th","content":"Ladys, gents, and miscellaneous, <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/i-get-a-kick-from-this-starter-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\">start your bank accounts</a>.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>NEXT UP!</b><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"> We\u2019ll be starting the Kickstarter for the Deluxe version of </span></span></span><b>EX3</b><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">\u2018s </span></span></span><b>Lunars </b><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">on February 12th \u2013 so don your beast forms and let loose a howl (or snarl or squawk or hiss) to let everyone know it\u2019s coming!</span></span></span> </div> </div> </div>*edit* Since people tend to ask, we're not likely to have a link to the Kickstarter itself until maybe the day before or the morning of. But if this topic is still rolling by then, I'll edit the link to it into this first post.<br /> <br /> *edit2* The Kickstarter will begin on February 12th at 2pm EST US time.<br /> <br /> *edit 3* <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/lunars-fangs-at-the-gate-for-exalted-3rd-ed?ref=nav_search&amp;result=project&amp;term=lunars\" target=\"_blank\">The Kickstarter is LIVE!</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":368,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","user":"The Unsung Hero","date":". 02-12-2019, 02:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-28T21:11:50-08:00","id":1283427,"title":"","content":"Ok, I can admit that I'm wrong. My auguries were poor and I was just straight up wrong in my expectations. <br /> <br /> I still think that being intentionally pessimistic and trying to keep people from jumping the firewand was a good thing though, because it made this a very welcome surprise and, had they announced a different book today, it might have helped prevent others from feeling entirely crushed.<br /> <br /> Still, this announcement does deserve a less restrained response I suppose.<br /> <br /> *ahem*<br /> <br /> *EEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEE!!!!!!!!*<br /> <br /> YAY!!!! LUNARS! YES! WOOOOO!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":