ing extras put into a companion like Heirs to the Shogunate (Miracles was just more charms...), aaaand that's it...</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd agree with you about the art slowing it down, but since we'll get the raw text anyway in the KS, I don't mind so much if art takes ages because it's in colour.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-29T10:58:13-08:00","id":1283539,"title":"","content":"If I can budget for it i\u2019m going to grab custom charm slots for Riddle themed powers.<br /> <br /> I figure I did Social Abilities (Performance and Presence) for Solars, and did Martial Abilities (Brawl and War) for Dragon Blooded (as you will hopefully see soon in Heirs to the Shogunate), so doing Mental Attribute Charms for Lunars feels right!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-29T10:58:43-08:00","id":1283540,"title":"","content":"@TheWizardofOz Yes, you are right. My rewa