serid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/872-apromor","name":"Apromor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar872_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"245"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-13T19:35:44-08:00","id":1287808,"title":"","content":"Regarding the super-disease thing, I'm kind of reminded of Project X-Ray, our scientists' efforts to turn swarms of bats into city-destroying bombs during World War II. It's one of those things where even a failure is going to go down in the history books.<br /> <br /> (The bats went astray and incinerated an Air Force base.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 02-13-2019, 10:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-14T07:23:37-08:00","id":1287930,"title":"","content":"And we have <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/lunars-fangs-at-the-gate-for-exalted-3rd-ed/posts/2416323\" target=\"_blank\">a sample of Charms</a> before tomorrow's preview, including the first in the Chimera tree and a Werewolf: The Apocalypse homage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-14T07:58:30-08:00","id":1287941,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eric Minton</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1283424-lunars-kickstarter-february-12th?p=1287722#post1287722\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's supposed to be targeting the Dragon-Blooded proper. It'll be addressed in post-editing development.</div> </div> </div> </div>Aww, that's too bad. I kind of liked the notion of a First Age Elder who was so twisted by centuries of hate that he looked at a second Nine-Fold Decimation as a good plan.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10995-abakus","name":"Abakus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-14T08:31:07-08:00","id":1287945,"title":"","content":"I like Silver Ripple Mirage. &quot;Fuck past Editions; the Lunar Exalted are the children of Luna herself, and their Charmset is going to reflect that&quot;.<br /> <br /> I like Debt of Borrowed Skin, but don't feel it is clearly written.<br /> <br /> How can the target feel the favor is worth their face AND whatever they're paying if they don't know their face is on the table?<br /> <br /> Does the target need to know that the task is serious or life-defining for the Lunar?<br /> <br /> Can the Lunar use this Charm in response to someone successfully influencing her with a bargain action?<br /> <br /> What about this?<br /> <br /> &quot;Upon the conclusion of a successful bargain action by or against the Lunar, the Lunar may begin a sacred hunt to take the human shape of her target, who is the second party of the agreement. She and her target must believe that the Lunar is agreeing to perform what is, for her, a serious or life-defining task (Exalted, p. 210) on his behalf. Her target must consider it to be equal in value to his heart\u2019s blood (along with any other compensation he provides for the task) at the time he does so, though he needn\u2019t know of or consent to that aspect of the exchange, and can\u2019t later renege on the deal.&quot;<br /> <br /> Still doesn't answer the question of value. There are people who would sooner die than let a Lunar have their face, and refuse to agree to a bargain that is ostensibly about saving their life. There are people who offer vast riches in return for the deed done, and consider that more than worth the deal and would not consider the exchange of their face a fair price on top of that.<br /> <br /> So if a person doesn't know they're giving up sole ownership of their face, then they ought to be thinking you're either bargaining to do a thing for no exchange at all, or for much less than they should be compensating you. So they should know the deal is too good to be true, or they should be thinking they're screwing you over.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"ke