starter-february-12th?p=1293139#post1293139\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's a lot of bugs that mimic plants instead and I'm surprised we haven't seen anything keying off that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well several Appearance charms do have Totemic or Protean clauses for spirit/animal shapes possessing the Camouflage merit. But nothing specific about mimicking flora.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-02T09:20:15-08:00","id":1293302,"title":"","content":"Looks like they either posted something in the wrong order or we\u2019re getting Artifacts tomorrow.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-02T12:54:28-08:00","id":1293339,"title":"","content":"So, known artifacts are a set of pan-pipes that influence the Wyld, a set of Slayer Khatars that break off pieces that burrow into their target's flesh, and Circe's Mutagenic Flamethrower.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.the