ry/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-14T10:46:06-07:00","id":1296741,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1283424-lunars-kickstarter-february-12th?p=1296709#post1296709\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have a bit of a shortlist of the following:</div> </div> </div> </div> i strongly support <i>Quetzalcoatlus</i> and <i>Jaekelopterus</i>, simply because they're so different from the animals we have so far.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-14T10:54:08-07:00","id":1296744,"title":"","content":"Sadly it looks like we aren't going to hit 300K, probably wont even manage to scrape by 290K.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-14T11:39:37-07:00","id":1296759,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mizu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1283424-lunars-kickstarter-february-12th?p=1296744#post1296744\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sadly it looks like we aren't going to hit 300K, probably wont even manage to scrape by 290K.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> We missed both, sadly. Still, it was a good campaign! I'm excited to see how Many-Faced Strangers turns out, and I'm real excited for Exigents next year!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13008-jade-wrought-sunfire","name":"Jade-Wrought Sunfire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-14T12:11:48-07:00","id":1296768,"title":"","content":"Have we gotten a solid Auroch yet? Considering Aurochs are all over the damn charm name it night be nice to get a legendary mega bull.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-14T12:15:41-07:00","id":1296770,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1283424-lunars-kickstarter-february-12th?p=1296768#post1296768\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Have we gotten a solid Auroch yet? Considering Aurochs are all over the damn charm name it night be nice to get a legendary mega bull.</div> </div> </div> </div>Aurochs have come out in Hundred Devils Night Parade.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-14T12:15:59-07:00","id":1296771,"title":"","content":"I am sad that the writers won't get their stretch goal, but I'm happy it went far enough that we'll get write-ups for those weirdos reigning over the Caul.<br /> <br /> Also Sublime Danger. Wouldn't mind seeing a bit more for Sublime Danger.<br /> <br /> A better art design for one.<br /> <br /> I'm just saying, I'm sure of the people who read the comic, most don't remember it, and the fact that of the four Exalted shirts I bought the one featuring her on the front being the only one still in regular circulation (and thus possibly helping me to be one of the few people that might remember her appearance) is pure coincidence. If she was to, say, have everything about her look besides the daiklave wings overhauled completely, I doubt anybody else would notice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-14T12:16:58-07:00","id":1296772,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1283424-lunars-kickstarter-february-12th?p=1296768#post1296768\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Have we gotten a solid Auroch yet?</div> </div> </div> </div> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/247445/Hundred-Devils-Night-Parade-Aurochs-and-Walkure\" target=\"_blank\">Right here.</a><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-14T12:37:53-07:00","id":1296776,"title":"","content":"The Lunars are the only thing holding me back from ruling that at my table that various species of modern animals don\u2019t exist in Creation, and prehistoric animals predominate... I think it would be great for the setting - except for the Lunars.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-14T13:45:32-07:00","id":1296784,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1283424-lunars-kickstarter-february-12th?p=1296776#post1296776\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Lunars are the only thing holding me back from ruling that at my table that various species of modern animals don\u2019t exist in Creation, and prehistoric animals predominate... I think it would be great for the setting - except for the Lunars.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sooo no farming?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-14T15:09:02-07:00","id":1296801,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1283424-lunars-kickstarter-february-12th?p=1296784#post1296784\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Sooo no farming?</div> </div> </div> </div>I didn\u2019t say no modern animals exist, just might be inclined to say a lot less. Also i\u2019d put various extinct animals, or domesticated versions that never existed of extinct animals (which is what the Yeddim already arguably are) in equivalent roles.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-14T18:58:50-07:00","id":1296857,"title":"","content":"So, I'm kind of curious. How did Lunars do compared to the average amount Onyx Path usually brings in on kickstarters? I don't really follow any of them except Exalted so I don't know how well their kickstarters do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-14T19:12:26-07:00","id":1296861,"title":"","content":"I honestly feel like we have plenty of dinosaurs already and that more focus should be put into other things.<br /> <br /> It's not that I don't like dinosaurs, it's just that I really don't want to play games where everyone is constantly transforming into them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/746-kunoichi","name":"Kunoichi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar746_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-15T01:10:47-07:00","id":1296933,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mizu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1283424-lunars-kickstarter-february-12th?p=1296857#post1296857\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, I'm kind of curious. How did Lunars do compared to the average amount Onyx Path usually brings in on kickstarters? I don't really follow any of them except Exalted so I don't know how well their kickstarters do.</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty good; it's in the top 10 by my reckoning (behind Mage 20, Ex3, Changeling 20, Werewolf 20, Scion 2e, WFHW and Wraith 20, just ahead of Dark Ages 20). It comes in behind WFHW in total pledged, but nudges ahead in terms of backers.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-16T04:49:42-07:00","id":1297206,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1283424-lunars-kickstarter-february-12th?p=1296771#post1296771\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also Sublime Danger. Wouldn't mind seeing a bit more for Sublime Danger.<br /> <br /> A better art design for one.<br /> <br /> I'm just saying, I'm sure of the people who read the comic, most don't remember it, and the fact that of the four Exalted shirts I bought the one featuring her on the front being the only one still in regular circulation (and thus possibly helping me to be one of the few people that might remember her appearance) is pure coincidence. If she was to, say, have everything about her look besides the daiklave wings overhauled completely, I doubt anybody else would notice.</div> </div> </div> </div>In contact to this, some conversation elsewhere got me looking back at Tale of the Visiting Flare, and it helped reiterate to me that Eska has a really great design.<br /> <br /> Especially when she's being drawn be Melissa Uran and her chest is covered by more than cloth strips that, even in their own context, look loose enough that her fighting style should cause them to slip off her breasts.<br /> <br /> I'm commenting on that because it stood out and bugs me, but seriously, I think the essentials of her design, the skin and multiple arms, and her eyes accentuated by her purple clothing, they really made for a memorable look to me.<br /> <br /> And I don't know what it is, but something about knowing what the Lunar combat Charms are now made her fight with Visiting Flare feel... a lot more impressive and powerful to me. When I'm imagining her movements in terms of the force and flexibility that would go behind them, it makes it feel less like a generic sword fight to me, and more like a fearsome clash of demigods.<br /> <br /> I mean, she gets in a few nasty hits on the Solar, comes back swinging despite her shattered weapons, and even though she loses, she effectively retreats despite having been bisected.<br /> <br /> Before I merely observed it, now I actively enjoy it.<br /> <br /> Heh, we're a long way from the time when people looked at that comic and thought that it was setting Lunars up to be chumps.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-17T14:15:53-07:00","id":1297580,"title":"","content":"The compiled Lunars pdf is now up and contains everything, including the fiction pieces that weren't posted during the KS. <br /> <br /> Silent Pearl is scary.<br /> <br /> Azu Tegama Asarkon is apparently a Shining Point Stylist.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-17T14:38:36-07:00","id":1297587,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure, you could describe all that with Dex charms. But could be.<br /> <br /> I liked the way the author described Elsewhere.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-17T15:13:48-07:00","id":1297593,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1283424-lunars-kickstarter-february-12th?p=1297587#post1297587\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not sure, you could describe all that with Dex charms. But could be.<br /> <br /> I liked the way the author described Elsewhere.</div> </div> </div> </div>The fact that he resheathes his sword after each strike is a bit of a give away for Single Point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-17T15:17:54-07:00","id":1297594,"title":"","content":"Did he? I didn't notice that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}